{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-sidebar-density#card-zh","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-sidebar-density","commit":"26cd3ee08baf78277a7c725708e8b9553522cc90","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-density 是面向 DSH 网页端的侧栏外观插件，在底部操作区增加密度入口，并在设置页提供同一组控制。用户可以选择标准、紧凑或舒适密度，设置自动、窄或宽三档侧栏宽度，并独立折叠导航、费用卡、品牌行、新会话按钮和工作区标题。状态保存在浏览器中，导入会话与移动访问入口可在相应功能存在时并入底部一行。适合希望在不改变会话内容的情况下调整侧栏布局的 DSH 网页用户；不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:69-95","lib/client.js:867-925","lib/client.js:1090-1117"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-sidebar-density#card-en","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-sidebar-density","commit":"26cd3ee08baf78277a7c725708e8b9553522cc90","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-density adds DSH web sidebar controls in the footer and settings. Choose standard, compact, or comfortable density; set automatic, narrow, or wide width; and fold five sidebar sections. Choices persist in browser storage. Optional import and mobile shortcuts appear when available.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:69-95","lib/client.js:867-925","lib/client.js:1090-1117"]}
