{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-sidebar-density#feature-1","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-sidebar-density","commit":"26cd3ee08baf78277a7c725708e8b9553522cc90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-density 的功能「密度预设」：可在侧栏底部按钮或设置分区打开控制面板，切换标准、紧凑、舒适密度；选择会写入浏览器存储并应用到侧栏。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:867-925","lib/client.js:1090-1117"]}
