{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-sidebar-density#feature-4","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-sidebar-density","commit":"26cd3ee08baf78277a7c725708e8b9553522cc90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-density 的功能「导入与移动快捷入口」：若检测到会话导入或移动访问入口，可在底部提供快捷按钮；导入优先打开右栏标签，移动访问转发到原入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:773-799","lib/client.js:991-1014"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-sidebar-density#caveat-1","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-sidebar-density","commit":"26cd3ee08baf78277a7c725708e8b9553522cc90","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-density 将选项保存在浏览器 localStorage；若浏览器存储不可用，本页仍使用默认外观，但设置不能持久保存。见 lib/client.js:527-553。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:527-553"]}
